ātiṣṭhottiṣṭha bhārata\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1549,\"bb\":1370,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/42/b1370/\",\"shadow_value\":\"tasmāt – therefore; ajñāna-sambhūtam – born of ignorance; hṛt-stham – situated in the heart; jñāna – of knowledge; asinā – by the weapon; ātmanaḥ – of the self; chittvā – cutting off; enam – this; saṁśayam – doubt; yogam – in yoga; ātiṣṭha – be situated; uttiṣṭha – stand up to fight; bhārata – O descendant of Bharata.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"tasmāt\",\"translation\":\"therefore\"},{\"word\":\"ajñāna-sambhūtam\",\"translation\":\"born of ignorance\"},{\"word\":\"hṛt-stham\",\"translation\":\"situated in the heart\"},{\"word\":\"jñāna\",\"translation\":\"of knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"asinā\",\"translation\":\"by the weapon\"},{\"word\":\"ātmanaḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the self\"},{\"word\":\"chittvā\",\"translation\":\"cutting off\"},{\"word\":\"enam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"saṁśayam\",\"translation\":\"doubt\"},{\"word\":\"yogam\",\"translation\":\"in yoga\"},{\"word\":\"ātiṣṭha\",\"translation\":\"be situated\"},{\"word\":\"uttiṣṭha\",\"translation\":\"stand up to fight\"},{\"word\":\"bhārata\",\"translation\":\"O descendant of Bharata\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1550,\"bb\":1371,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/42/b1371/\",\"body_value\":\"Therefore the doubts which have arisen in your heart out of ignorance should be slashed by the weapon of knowledge. Armed with yoga, O Bhārata, stand and fight.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1551,\"bb\":1372,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/42/b1372/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"p